WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.213
Today we will use art to communicate a helpful message. Our work connects with our

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:06.216
own local community.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:09.743
Choose one clear message about a community need.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.508
Draw a bold image that supports the message.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:18.020
Add a few large readable words and check the layout.
